03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mVyu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8af41977-d3df-4dbd-8ae6-664798453acb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"`call dein#recache_runtime()` してみる?","ts":"1632383734.386200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Rv5z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1151cee1-c805-4920-b628-311e92ec94ff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":thinking_face:","ts":"1632383639.385700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3wV6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b5b5de6-8f10-4895-ba29-ffec9ad9f2f9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"って感じです","ts":"1632383581.385500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e8B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2fd122f-fa64-4272-a5ef-28894b836c33","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"• Arch\n• denoのパスは通ってる\n• DeinUpdateは実行済みで、denopsは恐らく最新","ts":"1632383576.385200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AKD="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2c97632-50ae-42ae-a4c1-8f5e5604172b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"denopsのバージョンを上げてみてください","ts":"1632383506.384400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vtq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a620e77f-a573-47f3-a548-be480f5d876b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"skkeletonで `denops#plugin#wait`がなくて `-1` が返ってくるんですけど原因わかるかたいませんか?","ts":"1632383476.383800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AWrT0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0417fb7f-2774-4ddf-963b-aa6d3cdc30e0","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"にゃる！あざます！ hook_add 内で除外するようにします！","ts":"1632383021.382200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GWR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7167711d-25e8-4698-9525-2394d26ec606","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあでも `hook_source` がsourceされないと呼ばれないって考えると、addはsourceされようがされまいが呼ばれるっていうのが動作として一貫してそう","ts":"1632382962.380900","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1632382986.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vl6xZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9a43bd7-9059-4f40-8588-563bf6620da3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"non-lazyでhookは呼ぶとしてifでdisableだとskipされるかな(ルー構文)","ts":"1632382935.380400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d7D8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a6518ff-8c35-46b4-97a6-250286dc7451","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あーほんとだ、そこは `post_source` と同じか","ts":"1632382834.379400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kwt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0a192e6-ebeb-4bae-8d48-1d6f2b3e771a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"non-lazyでも設定すれば呼ばれますね","ts":"1632382820.379000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iVK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9183d34b-9b50-4925-bdb5-0d7455e6158e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"non-lazyだったら呼び出す必要がありますね、書いてある通り","ts":"1632382818.378900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=E5tN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75c93a2e-dae5-4ca5-b0f0-d075e9715832","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"soucedなので、こっちはスキップされるはず?","ts":"1632382800.378200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t8c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e015b5c-b0ac-4470-bc5a-e1072895e51e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"non-lazyだと呼ばれないかな？","ts":"1632382796.378000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ud=2"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *dein-options-hook_source*\nhook_source     (String) or (Function)\n                It is executed before plugins are sourced.\n                Note: The \"sourced\" means after |dein#end()| or when\n                |VimEnter| or autoloaded.\n \n                call dein#add('artur-shaik/vim-javacomplete2')\n                call dein#config('artur-shaik/vim-javacomplete2', {\n                \\ 'hook_source': 'autocmd FileType java\n                \\                 setlocal omnifunc=javacomplete#Complete'\n                \\ })\n                function! Func() abort\n                  autocmd FileType qf nnoremap \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; r :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;Qfreplace\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n                endfunction\n                call dein#source('thinca/vim-qfreplace',\n                \\ 'hook_source': function('Func'))\n \n                Note: non lazy plugins' |dein-options-hook_source| cannot be\n                called.  You must call it by |dein#call_hook()| if needed.\n \n                call dein#begin()\n                ...\n                call dein#end()\n                call dein#call_hook('source')\n```","ts":"1632382779.377300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"e14dbb2c-4566-44a1-9cc8-308db0e21062","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":help hook_source","ts":"1632382779.377200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"43O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7459b71-561e-49cf-97c9-48a6a2dc7926","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`hook_source` だとどうなんでしょう?","ts":"1632382753.376900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BIS7+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"598f1e10-afe5-47fe-b8c7-652b589897d0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど、登録を無効化するわけじゃなくて、あくまでロードしないだけと","ts":"1632382669.376100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hGhA"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *dein-options-if*\nif              (Bool) or (String)\n                If set to |v:false|, dein doesn't load the plugin.\n                If it is |String|, dein will eval it.\n                If you don't set it, dein will register (enable) the plugin.\n                Note: You cannot disable plugins register in dein if you use\n                the option.\n```","ts":"1632382639.375700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"7c100fc4-d41a-44ca-b4fa-06a6f4053a0e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":h dein-options-if","ts":"1632382639.375600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IePS"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *dein-toml-hook_add*\n                hook_add        (String)\n                It is the global |dein-options-hook_add|.\n                It is executed in |dein#end()|.\n```","ts":"1632382538.375300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"960bc40a-7092-4018-b146-cd4f5faccfed","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":help hook_add","ts":"1632382538.375200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8tjj"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Update success: vim-denops/denops.vim (4dde84b =\u0026gt; b5f98f3)","ts":"1632382530.375000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T