e","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Update success: cohama/lexima.vim (89bf4dc =\u0026gt; 6b716e2)","ts":"1632382526.374100","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"496c5a1e-2928-4c71-9e37-1d45276d1d0e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":vimhelp plugin update","ts":"1632382525.374000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UgYyG"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Utilities for :help\n\nCommands:\n  /vimhelp plugin  Manage Vim plugins\n\nUnknown argument: update","ts":"1632382514.373700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"435103ef-a850-49eb-89dd-0908ba35f7d1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":vimhelp update","ts":"1632382514.373600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aTs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56091808-52bb-486c-9dd6-0757e6c704b8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うーん、期待動作として、「ifでdisabledになったのなら、まったく動いてほしくない」なんだろうけどどうなんだっけ","ts":"1632382507.373400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CVg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89221bf3-57af-4274-a421-74f3a472c53b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あとはこれかな","ts":"1632382497.373200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W/CJ4"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *dein-options-on_if*\non_if           (String)\n                If it is evaluated and it is non-zero, dein will call\n                |dein#source()|.\n                The default evaluate timings are \"BufRead\", \"BufNewFile\",\n                \"VimEnter\" and \"FileType\".\n                If |dein-options-on_event| exists, it is evaluated when\n                |dein-options-on_event|.\n \n                For example:  \n                call dein#add('blueyed/vim-diminactive',\n                \\ {'on_event': 'WinEnter', 'on_if': 'winnr(\"$\") \u0026gt; 1'})\n```","ts":"1632382490.372800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"0baa0a8d-82e8-464d-90d9-c627dbb086d7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":":h dein-options-on_if","ts":"1632382490.372700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tv0v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e220374-80b4-42bb-a544-6bccfc0a5f4e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"hook_addの中でif書くだとダメなんですか?","ts":"1632382425.371800","edited":{"user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","ts":"1632382439.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9rZC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47c80a0c-7270-4fb6-8edf-03d9e9b7e16a","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"dein の hook_add って、 if で条件不一致の時も実行されます？\n以下みたいなやつで、 Windows 以外だと hook_add される必要ないので呼ばれないのがいいかなぁと思うのですが・・・\n```[[plugins]]\nrepo = 'mattn/transparency-windows-vim'\nif = \"has('win32')\"\nhook_add = '''\nlet g:Transparency_FocusGained = 15\nlet g:Transparency_FocusLost = 50\n'''```","ts":"1632380784.371100","thread_ts":"1632380784.371100","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fspt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cc23cab-3576-4de4-a09e-d34700bb0ba2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"hook_addは不一致のとき呼ばれません","ts":"1632394062.448100","thread_ts":"1632380784.371100","parent_user_id":"UEX9VPSET","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1f/B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34b70e23-a0da-4673-81c9-fecf6f42a3bd","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"